    "text": "wabi.tv\nwebsite\nBangor\nWaterfront Concerts discuss positives and negatives during busy show season\nBy Grace Bradley,\n6 hours agoBANGOR, Maine (WABI) - With four shows over five days this week, concert season is in full swing here in Bangor. Waterfront Concerts welcomed Live and Collective Soul Wednesday night with Chicago, Bret Michaels, Goo Goo Dolls, and Jerry Seinfeld coming to the Maine Savings Amphitheater in the next week.",
